# --- Added during pre-production audit (2026-08-22) ---

# Kotlin incremental compilation state
/.kotlin

# Release artifacts stay archived on disk, not in git: an AAB is ~9 MB and its
# mapping.txt another ~40 MB, per release.
/Releases

# Pre-audit source snapshot. Safe to delete once the git history below is
# trusted; kept out of the repo either way.
/_backup_pre_audit_*

# Debugging leftovers at the repo root - logcat dumps and repro screenshots.
# The leading slash anchors these to the root, so design/*.png and the launcher
# icons under app/src/main/res/ are unaffected.
/*.logcat
/*.png

# Local-only Claude Code settings
/.claude/settings.local.json

# Machine-specific IDE state: which emulator was last selected (embeds a local
# AVD path), device-manager UI state, and local assistant preferences. None of
# it is project configuration.
/.idea/deploymentTargetSelector.xml
/.idea/deviceManager.xml
/.idea/studiobot.xml
